  "reading": [
    "Elo 是相对分，不同切片（i2v / t2v）不可直接比较；置信区间重叠时名次差异不显著（来源：Arena results 页）。",
    "NFe = 模型实际前向次数 = num_inference_steps − 1（终点的 sigma=0 不计算）；6 NFE 即 7 步（来源：Arena conventions）。",
    "同名方案的不同版本（v1.0/v1.1/v0.2…）是不同参赛条目，不能合并看待（来源：Arena variants.json）。",
    "计时基准为 RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB、bf16、无 CPU 卸载；换算出的倍率只对同基准有意义（来源：Arena timing_reference）。",
    "榜单反映的是“人眼偏好投票 + 固定计时”，不等于在你的卡上、你的工作流里的表现（来源：本站估算方法说明）。"
  ],
  "reading_en": [
    "Elo is relative and slice-specific (i2v vs t2v are not comparable); overlapping CIs mean the rank gap is not significant (source: Arena results page).",
    "NFE = actual model forwards = num_inference_steps − 1 (terminal sigma=0 is not evaluated); 6 NFE means 7 steps (source: Arena conventions).",
    "Different versions of the same family (v1.0/v1.1/v0.2…) are separate entries (source: Arena variants.json).",
    "Timing reference: RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, bf16, no CPU offload; speedups are only meaningful on that baseline (source: Arena timing_reference).",
    "The arena measures human preference on pre-generated clips plus fixed timing — not your card, your workflow (source: WhichH3 data notes)."
  ]
